## Configuration

Before uploading the Arduino code to the ESP32, configure the required hardware connections and communication settings according to the project circuit.

Make sure the GSM and GPS modules have appropriate power supplies and that the TX/RX connections are correctly configured.

## Important

Do not upload sensitive information such as:

- Personal phone numbers
- Wi-Fi passwords
- API keys
- Authentication tokens
- Private credentials

Replace sensitive values with placeholders before publishing the repository.

